# Product PRD gate

Before **greenfield** features, new **CMake plugin targets**, or new top-level product folders:

1. Read [`docs/COMPANY_MEMORY_INDEX.md`](../../docs/COMPANY_MEMORY_INDEX.md) and the product `ARCHITECTURE.md`.
2. Ensure a PRD exists using [`docs/templates/PRD_TEMPLATE.md`](../../docs/templates/PRD_TEMPLATE.md) (agent: **code-project-planner**).
3. PRD must list **success criteria** with verifiable commands; implementation PRs link the PRD path.

Exceptions: one-line bugfixes, docs-only, or user explicitly waives PRD (`OVERRIDE(R4): …`).

Every product `ARCHITECTURE.md` should link its PRD or `docs/products/<id>.md`.
